<title>POLAND: ZLOTY PARITY RATE 3.2283 VS DLR, 1.8655 VS MARK.</title>
<headline>ZLOTY PARITY RATE 3.2283 VS DLR, 1.8655 VS MARK.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland said it set the parity rate of the zloty at 3.2283 against the dollar and at 1.8655 against the mark for Tuesday, April 15.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
